{
  "id": "JOB.35",
  "number": "35",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 35",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et Élihu reprit la parole et dit :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Penses-tu que ceci soit fondé, que tu aies dit : Je suis plus juste que",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.35.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.35.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car tu as demandé quel profit tu en as : Quel avantage en ai-je de plus que si j'avais péché ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je te répliquerai, moi, par des paroles, et à tes amis avec toi :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Regarde les cieux et vois, et contemple les nuées : elles sont plus hautes que toi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si tu pèches, quel tort lui causes-tu ? et si tes transgressions se multiplient, que lui as-tu fait ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si tu es juste, que lui donnes-tu, ou que reçoit-il de ta main ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour un homme comme toi ta méchanceté [peut être quelque chose], et pour un fils d'homme, ta justice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On crie à cause de la multitude des oppressions, et on appelle au secours à cause du bras des grands ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et on ne dit pas : Où est",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✝Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.35.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.35.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", mon créateur, qui donne des chants de joie dans la nuit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui nous rend plus instruits que les bêtes de la terre, et plus sages que les oiseaux des cieux ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alors on crie, et il ne répond pas, à cause de l'orgueil des méchants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Certainement ce qui est vanité",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.35.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.35.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne l'écoute pas, et le Tout-puissant ne le regarde pas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quoique tu dises que tu ne le",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "vois pas, le jugement est devant lui ; attends-le donc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et maintenant, si sa colère n'a pas encore visité, [Job] ne",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "connaît-il pas [sa] grande arrogance ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et Job ouvre sa bouche vainement ; il entasse des paroles sans science.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.35.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JOB.36",
    "number": "36",
    "bookId": "JOB"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "JOB.34",
    "number": "34",
    "bookId": "JOB"
  }
}